	<div class="vc_col-sm-9 wpb_column column_container">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3>Gallardo Securities was established in 2013 with the aim to deliver its clients first class execution services in equity derivatives markets. Our experienced team of inter-dealer brokers is active in a vast array of cash, vanilla and structured derivative products.</h3>

		</div> 
