	<div class="vc_col-sm-9 wpb_column column_container wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_bottom-to-top">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Gallardo Securities is an Inter-dealer brokerage firm based in London with a primary focus in OTC and exchange listed cash and equity derivatives markets.</p>
<p>Our core strength lies in our extensive relationships with a wide range of market participants: investment banks, market makers, hedge funds and a variety of financial institutions all around the globe. Our direct access to the whole spectrum of market participants allows us to deliver our customers with the most competitive bid-offer spreads across a variety of financial products in the most efficient fashion.</p>
<p>Our objective is to provide our clients with liquidity across all markets, fast and effective execution by preserving anonymity throughout the process following the highest standards of professionalism.</p>
<p>We take pride by developing our business relationships based on our ethics, professionalism and hard work.</p>

		</div> 
